# Implementation Plan - Fintech Latam Knowledge Graph

This plan outlines the process of transforming raw fintech data into a structured knowledge base in Markdown format, optimized for Obsidian and Cosma.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> To proceed, I need the raw data (Excel, CSV, or text list) you mentioned. I will focus on the following fields: Name, Country, Vertical, Website, and Year of Foundation.

## Proposed Changes

### [Component] Markdown Knowledge Base

#### [NEW] [01-DiccionarioDatos.md](file:///c:/Users/Antonio/OneDrive/Downloads/Radar_Fintech_Latam_SUMSUB_MASTER_GTM (1)/01-DiccionarioDatos.md)
Standard definitions for fields like `ID`, `Vertical`, `Segment`, and `Status`.

#### [NEW] [02-FintechMaster.md](file:///c:/Users/Antonio/OneDrive/Downloads/Radar_Fintech_Latam_SUMSUB_MASTER_GTM (1)/02-FintechMaster.md)
The primary list of 3,000+ fintechs, organized by country, using `[[links]]` for entities and `#tags` for attributes.

#### [NEW] [03-Asociaciones.md](file:///c:/Users/Antonio/OneDrive/Downloads/Radar_Fintech_Latam_SUMSUB_MASTER_GTM (1)/03-Asociaciones.md)
Mapping of national and regional fintech associations.

#### [NEW] [04-Reguladores.md](file:///c:/Users/Antonio/OneDrive/Downloads/Radar_Fintech_Latam_SUMSUB_MASTER_GTM (1)/04-Reguladores.md)
